<title>FRANCE: ATHLETICS-DRAGILA EQUALS WOMEN'S POLE VAULT RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-DRAGILA EQUALS WOMEN'S POLE VAULT RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stacy Dragila of the United States equalled the women's pole vault indoor world record when she cleared 4.40 metres at the indoor world championships on Sunday.</p>
<p>Emma George of Australia set the mark on December 10, 1996 in Melbourne.</p>
</text>
